WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.950
Section 8.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.800
Reform — what it would actually take.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.087
Not wish-list thinking, but concrete structural changes.

00:00:09.087 --> 00:00:12.562
An independent commissioner appointment process.

00:00:12.562 --> 00:00:15.712
Binding oversight with enforcement power.

00:00:15.712 --> 00:00:18.287
Mandatory body cameras.

00:00:18.287 --> 00:00:21.325
A civilian intelligence review board.

00:00:21.325 --> 00:00:23.862
Real whistleblower protection.

00:00:23.862 --> 00:00:27.225
Every commission has recommended these changes.

00:00:27.225 --> 00:00:29.612
None have been implemented.
